menu "KeyKeeper2 wireless typing"

    config WIRELESS_TRANSPORT_BLE
        bool "Talk to the dongle over BLE instead of the UART cable"
        depends on KEYKEEPER_KKPROTO
        default n
        help
            On: the vault finds and connects to its dongle over Bluetooth LE (component blelink, NimBLE). Pairing
            looks for a dongle whose pairing window is open; afterwards the vault reconnects to the paired dongle's
            address by itself.

            Needs the NimBLE host in sdkconfig: CONFIG_BT_ENABLED=y, CONFIG_BT_NIMBLE_ENABLED=y,
            CONFIG_BT_BLUEDROID_ENABLED=n, CONFIG_BT_NIMBLE_ATT_PREFERRED_MTU=247 (see components/blelink/README.md).

            Off (default): the UART cable between the boards (GPIO10 TX / GPIO11 RX).

endmenu
